    628  f24b							; LaserWallClamp $F25A (name+pin kept — sim_frame_budget beam_cols keys on
    629  f24b							; the entry; redesign 2026-10-08): CONTACT wall test — tests ONLY the
    630  f24b							; missile TIP cell (one display col x band rows RoomY+2..3) instead of
    631  f24b							; walking the whole swept path. The sweep/phase machine is gone: bank0
    632  f24b							; LaserInput now travels LaserX +/-4px/frame from the eye, capped at the
    633  f24b							; old sweep extent (RoomX+20 / max(RoomX-20,0)) and resets on contact, so
    634  f24b							; there is no path to clamp and CollisionX is never modified (old S6
    635  f24b							; mid-wall tip clamp retired with the sweep).
    636  f24b							; In (bank0 LaserInput .LaserGo): CollisionX = LaserX, drawn M0 = [A-7,A],
